{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d77d08ce-05d4-457b-ba2f-5f041ab41ee1",
    "name": "Mercur — Store Onboarding (Vendor)",
    "description": "Vendor store-onboarding API (M2 + M2b + M2c).\n\nImport, then run requests top-to-bottom: Auth > Register captures {{token}} and a unique {{email}}; later requests auto-capture {{store_id}}, {{location_id}}, {{draft_id}} into collection variables via test scripts. Set {{base_url}} if not http://localhost:9000.\n\nDrafts flow (M2c): Create draft -> Save step 1..4 -> Get/Resume -> Submit (creates the real store).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "26776924",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/26776924-d77d08ce-05d4-457b-ba2f-5f041ab41ee1?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register member",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('email')) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('email', 'vendor_' + Date.now() + '@test.com');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token); }",
                  "pm.test('has token', () => pm.expect(j.token).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/member/emailpass/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "member",
                "emailpass",
                "register"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login member (refresh token)",
          "event": [
            {
